@* Injects the plugin's stylesheets into the host <head> via HeadOutlet. The host serves these from its
   in-memory asset store at /_content/credify/. Shared by every Credify page so the links live in one place.
   Both the Tailwind output and the hand-written CSS are included. *@
<HeadContent>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/_content/credify/plugin.css"/>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/_content/credify/custom.css"/>
</HeadContent>
